 "remarks": "A turnkey opportunity for investors, with a tenant already in place, or a well-positioned first home for buyers thinking ahead. One mile from the Stamford train station, this two-bedroom townhouse-style condo sits close to the city center but feels apart from it - quiet, unhurried. The main level has a foyer, an easy great room, a defined dining area, and a half bath. The kitchen has wood cabinets with granite counters, and stainless steel appliances. Upstairs, two bedrooms with real closet space share an updated full bath with tub and shower, plus a separate linen closet. Harwood floors run through both levels. In-unit washer and dryer. Attic storage with built-in shelving. Two parking spots - one assigned, under the building; one open, in the lot. Scalzi Park and Mill River Park are a short walk away, along with restaurants, coffee shops, gyms, and grocers.",
